WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.620 --> 00:00:04.880
[Caine]: [distorted scream]
Guys, I set up a musical adventure for you today!

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:08.190
But the song starts at 12:30,
and I didn't have time to write lyrics!

00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:09.860
You'll have to make up the lyrics on the spot,

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:11.720
or suffer a horrible punishment!

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:12.880
[Pomni]: What punishment?!

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:14.390
[Caine]: 12:30!
[Pomni]: [screams]

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:17.040
I c-- I can't sing without a script!

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:19.130
[Caine]:Hup!
[Pomni]:This is a shampoo bottle!

00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:20.810
[Caine]:The song, Pomni!
[Pomni]: [stammers]

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:22.440
[sung to tune of "I Am The Very Model"]
♪ Contains citric acid, sodium chloride ♪

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:24.250
♪ Cocamidopropyl betaine, fumic acid ♪

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:25.960
♪ Butylphenyl, methylpropional, uh ♪

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:28.300
♪ Magnesium nitrate, PEG-60 almond glycerides ♪
[Bubble]: Sounds delicious!

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.220
[Pomni]: ♪ Methylchloroisothiazolinone ♪

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:31.560
And, uh, water!

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:32.940
[Gangle]: ♪ I'm super happy, never sappy ♪

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:34.020
♪ When I have my have my happy mask ♪

00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:35.320
♪ Don't break it, Jax!
Don't break it, Jax! ♪

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:37.480
♪ Don't break it, Jax! That's all I ask! ♪
[glass shatters]

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:39.680
What the [HOOOONK]???

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:42.220
Kinger!!!
[Kinger]: Oop, sorry.

00:00:42.220 --> 00:00:45.570
Just... [chomps]
eatin' a little banana.

00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:47.960
[Ragatha]: ♪ Sunny days and rainbows,
getting hugs and petting kitty cats ♪

00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:49.960
♪ When you feel down and in the mud
 instead of frowning ♪

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:51.470
Do a silly dance!

00:00:51.470 --> 00:00:53.280
Take it away, Zooble.

00:00:54.690 --> 00:00:56.020
[Zooble]: This is stupid.

00:00:57.170 --> 00:00:58.680
[Caine]: Boo! Come on!

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:01.410
Let loose those angelic pipes, Zooble!
[Zooble]: AAAAAGH!

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:03.810
[Jax]: ♪ Zooble's part was terrible
that act was so unbearable ♪

00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:06.330
♪ I'm super duper hoping that
those limbs are not repairable ♪

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:07.240
[chuckles] AUGH!

00:01:07.240 --> 00:01:08.660
[jazzy remix of "Digital Circus" theme plays]

00:01:08.660 --> 00:01:10.980
[Kinger]: [jazzy voice]
♪ Y'all know me as Kinger ♪

00:01:10.980 --> 00:01:13.150
♪ But on the stage, I'm Singer ♪

00:01:13.150 --> 00:01:15.620
♪ Gonna serenade ya, baby ♪

00:01:15.620 --> 00:01:20.440
♪ With my own
Tony-winning zingeeeeeeeers ♪

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:21.090
Ow.

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:22.480
[Caine]: Alright, Pomni.

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:25.790
Let's bring this hootenanny home
with a classic duet!

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:28.120
[Pomni]: Gummigoo??
[Gummigoo]: Crikey!

00:01:28.120 --> 00:01:30.280
[Pomni]: [gasps] Gummigoo!
Oh, my gosh!

00:01:30.280 --> 00:01:31.980
I can't believe you're alive!

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:33.320
[Gummigoo]: Crikey!
[Pomni]: W-Wha...?

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:35.070
[glitched audio]
Crikey -- Down under --

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:39.440
[Pomni]: AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA

00:01:39.440 --> 00:01:40.580
[Caine]: AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA
AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA

00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:41.900
[Bubble]: AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHH
[Caine]: AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHH
AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA

00:01:41.900 --> 00:01:43.500
[Pomni]: AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAHHH!!!

00:01:44.280 --> 00:01:46.000
[Caine]: Congratulations!

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.640
You completed your musical adventure!

00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:51.270
As your punishment, I am going to...

00:01:51.270 --> 00:01:53.320
[booming, echoing voice]
MASS PRODUCE YOU.

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:55.140
[Pomni]:
Wait, we're still being punished?!

00:01:55.140 --> 00:01:56.600
[Caine]: [normal voice]
That's the thing about life, Pomni.

00:01:56.600 --> 00:01:57.760
Sometimes, you get...

00:01:57.760 --> 00:01:59.370
[booming, echoing voice]
MASS PRODUCED.

00:01:59.370 --> 00:02:01.640
[normal voice]
These scrumdiddlyumptious bumpkins

00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:03.680
could be yours today!

00:02:03.680 --> 00:02:06.200
Along with this delicious sticker pack

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:08.370
featuring all your favorite characters

00:02:08.370 --> 00:02:11.360
as sweet, teeth-rotting treats!

00:02:11.360 --> 00:02:13.510
Your friend, the Gummigoo keychain,

00:02:13.510 --> 00:02:16.320
in all his NON-EDIBLE glory.

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:18.380
Perfect for NOT EATING.

00:02:18.380 --> 00:02:20.110
And this complete pin line,

00:02:20.110 --> 00:02:22.810
pinning all your favorite characters
in a line together

00:02:22.810 --> 00:02:24.680
as their completely pinnable selves

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:27.650
in this completely pinnable complete pin line!

00:02:27.650 --> 00:02:30.530
[Jax]: And me, Jax,
the marketable vinyl figure.

00:02:30.530 --> 00:02:32.300
[chuckles] What can I say?

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:36.050
People paying money to just admire me all day
sounded like a sweet gig.

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:39.400
[Caine]: Right you are, Jax,
the marketable vinyl figure!

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:43.890
Him and all these items are available now
at digitalcircus.store

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:44.520
That’s...

